 "text": "Hi, how's your day treating you? Not weird at all, it' great way to spend time together without the pressure of being out with others. Sure, take your time. So, a picnic alone, is it bothering anyone? It varies a lot. Some people donate a small amount every month, while others save up before something like a graduation. The school usually gives you a range of what they expect. Rough guide would be what families can afford compared to how much is already been raised. Pick a park with good food and games, and try to be there early so you've got it to yourself.",
